all flower"},{"surface":"ஞாழல்","parts":[{"text":"ஞாழல்","lemma":"ஞாழல்","gloss":"tiger-claw tree"}],"gloss":"tiger-claw tree"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"செவ்வி","parts":[{"text":"செவ்வி","lemma":"செவ்வி","gloss":"freshness"}],"gloss":"freshness"},{"surface":"மருதின்","parts":[{"text":"மருது","lemma":"மருது","gloss":"marutam tree"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the marutam tree"},{"surface":"செம்மலொடு","parts":[{"text":"செம்மல்","lemma":"செம்மல்","gloss":"withered flower"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with withered flowers"},{"surface":"தாஅய்த்","parts":[{"text":"தாஅய்","lemma":"தாஅய்","gloss":"having spread"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"consonant"}],"gloss":"having spread"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"துறைஅணிந்","parts":[{"text":"துறைஅணிந்","lemma":"துறைஅணிந்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தன்றவ","parts":[{"text":"தன்றவ","lemma":"தன்றவ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ரூரே","parts":[{"text":"ரூரே","lemma":"ரூரே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யிறையிறந்","parts":[{"text":"யிறையிறந்","lemma":"யிறையிறந்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"திலங்குவளை","parts":[{"text":"திலங்குவளை","lemma":"திலங்குவளை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஞெகிழச்","parts":[{"text":"ஞெகிழச்","lemma":"ஞெகிழச்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சாஅய்ப்","parts":[{"text":"சாஅய்ப்","lemma":"சாஅய்ப்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"புலம்பு","parts":[{"text":"புலம்பு","lemma":"புலம்பு","gloss":"loneliness"}],"gloss":"loneliness"},{"surface":"அணிந்தன்று","parts":[{"text":"அணிந்து","lemma":"அணி","gloss":"having adorned"},{"text":"அன்று","lemma":"அன்று","gloss":"it"}],"gloss":"it adorned"},{"surface":"அவர்","parts":[{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"அவர்","gloss":"his"}],"gloss":"his"},{"surface":"மணந்த","parts":[{"text":"மணந்த","lemma":"மணம்","gloss":"embraced"}],"gloss":"embraced"},{"surface":"தோளே","parts":[{"text":"தோள்","lemma":"தோள்","gloss":"shoulders"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"shoulders indeed"}]}],"literal":"White mustard seed like small flowers of the tiger-claw tree, / with the fresh, withered flowers of the marutam tree, having spread, / has adorned the water-ghat, his town! Slipped past the joints of the wrist, / so that the shining bangles loosen, having grown thin, / loneliness has adorned the shoulders that embraced him!","translation":"The small flowers of the tiger-claw tree, resembling white mustard seeds, have spread along with the fresh, fallen blossoms of the marutam tree, beautifully decorating the water-ghat of his town. But here, my shoulders that once embraced him have grown so thin that my shining bangles slip past my wrists, and they are now adorned only with loneliness.","modern":"வெண்கடுகு போன்ற சிறிய பூக்களைக் கொண்ட ஞாழல் மரத்தின் மலர்கள், புதிய மருத மரத்தின் உதிர்ந்த மலர்களோடு கலந்து பரவி, அவருடைய ஊரின் நீர்த்துறையை அழகுபடுத்துகின்றன. ஆனால், அவர் தழுவிய என் தோள்களோ, மெலிந்துபோய் விளங்கும் வளையல்கள் மணிக்கட்டைத் தாண்டி நெகிழ்ந்து கழலும்படி வாடி, தனிமையையே அணிகலனாகக் கொண்டுள்ளன.","explanation":"The heroine speaks to herself or her confidante during the hero's absence, contrasting the beauty of his town with her own physical decline. In his fertile Marutam landscape, the river-ghat is beautifully adorned with yellow ñāḻal flowers and fresh, fallen marutam blossoms. In stark contrast, her own shoulders, which once embraced him, are now \"adorned\" only with loneliness (pulampu). Her grief has caused her to waste away so much that her shining bangles (ilaṅku vaḷai) slip past her wrists (iṟai iṟantu). The contrast between the flourishing, decorated town of the hero and the desolate, wasting body of the heroine heightens the emotional pain of separation.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.3,1.4],[1.4,3.0],[3.0,3.3],[3.3,3.83],[3.83,4.7],[4.7,6.0],[6.0,6.47],[6.47,6.83],[7.29,8.44],[9.21,9.6],[9.6,9.97],[9.97,9.97],[9.97,9.97],[9.97,12.2],[12.2,12.6],[12.6,12.7]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.4],[1.4,1.5],[1.5,3.37],[3.37,3.37],[3.37,3.37],[3.37,4.67],[4.67,6.3],[6.3,11.8],[11.8,11.8],[11.8,11.8],[11.8,11.86],[11.86,11.97],[11.97,12.08],[12.08,12.08],[12.08,12.3],[12.3,12.7],[12.7,12.9]]},"sync":[[["ஐயவி","white mustard seed"]],[["அன்ன","like"]],[["சிறுவீ","small flower"]],[["ஞாழல்","tiger-claw tree"]],[["செவ்வி","freshness"]],[["மருதின்","of the marutam tree"]],[["செம்மலொடு","with withered flowers"]],[["தாஅய்த்","having spread"]],[["துறைஅணிந்",""]],[["தன்றவ",""]],[["ரூரே",""]],[["யிறையிறந்",""]],[["திலங்குவளை",""]],[["ஞெகிழச்",""]],[["சாஅய்ப்",""]],[["புலம்பு","loneliness"],["அணிந்தன்று","it adorned"]],[["அணிந்தன்று","it adorned"],["அவர்","his"]],[["மணந்த","embraced"]],[["தோளே","shoulders indeed"]]]}